in the first episode of the blood-borne  guide we found this young girl hiding in  her home alone playing with a small  music box for comfort hmm I don't know  your voice lets her know that smell  and you hunt her she's really looking  for my mom she never came back from the  hunt and she went to find him  but now she's going to I'm all alone and  scared  really oh thank you my mom wears a red  jeweled brooch it's so big and beautiful  you won't miss it  oh I mustn't forget if you find my mum  you've had this music box it plays and  of Daddy's favorite songs every one  daddy forgets us we placed the home  saying he remembers not just this city  and in love without it  look how this music box please and me  you can do it if you play the music box  while fighting Gascoigne he forgets the  hunt and remembers instead the wife he  murdered and the little girl he left  behind though if you play it for him too  many times it speeds up his  transformation into a beast as he  abandons everything the fight against  Gascoigne is a frantic even fight  between two hunters and you have to  master the art of trading hits managing  of stamina timing your dodges and  shooting him at the perfect moment I  recommend everyone defeat him this way  it's an incredible experience and you'll  feel like a god when you finally defeat  him that said there is an easy way to  defeat Gascoigne and maybe that's why  you're here now so I'll tell you as soon  as you enter the boss room run to the  right and get behind this group of  gravestones you want to stay locked on  to Gascoigne and always keep him on the  opposite side of the stones now equip  the longest range weapon you have and  simply strike away at him on the  opposite side of the gravestones other  sets of gravestones will work but I do  like this one because you're always only  one dodge away from being opposite him  the best weapon for this is definitely  the threaded cane second best is the  hunter's  and you might be able to manage it with  the saw clever now if you watched the  last episode of the guide I showed you  how to get the saw hunters badge which  lets you purchase all three starter  weapons from the messengers having the  threaded cane makes this strategy a  complete cakewalk because you can easily  keep Gascoigne on the opposite side and  it's quite difficult for him to hit you  at this range you can't do this for the  entire fight Poe Gascoigne has three  phases each triggered at a different  third of his life in his first the  hunter's axe is shortened in the second  the axe is extended and in his last he  fully transforms into a beast and  becomes incredibly aggressive each stage  is progressively harder than the last  and the last stage is the hardest of all  especially if you're trying to choose  him in his third form he destroys those  gravestones you love so much but not  trees or statues he doesn't destroy  those if you're desperate to defeat him  head over to the back of the arena and  keep him trapped in between this tree  and this statue it's very easy to get  him stuck here and even if he does get  around it just mash that role button and  get to the other side so now let's talk  about defeating him with a little bit  less cheese you should still use the  gravestones to your advantage just maybe  not as much as before just make sure  you're always behind a few when you go  to heal they stopped his spray of  bullets and also you've got to make use  of how aggressive he is it makes him  very predictable charge up those are  twos when he's walking towards you also  bear in mind that he almost always  shoots his gun as soon as he does a dash  while he's in his first phase some of  the most fun you can have is avoiding  his short axe and trying to be even more  offensive than he is he's fairly easy to  stagger so it's easy to get your health  back and his axe doesn't do that much  damage in this state and since it's  quite short it is quite easy to avoid  you can spend some bullets on reposts  here if you have more than you know what  to do with but I would recommend saving  them for the next phases because you're  going to want to get through those very  fast in his second phase the axe is  extended and obviously he has a lot more  reach staying near him will result in a  lot of his horizontal swings which make  it difficult for you to dodge to his  side's  you should be backpedaling here trying  to stay outside  axes range I rely on a lot of gunshot  reposts to get me through this phase  since his second phase attacks are a  little bit easier to predict than his  first ones if you are going to melee him  try and get in at least two attacks  because sometimes it takes two to  stagger him  you can't stun lock him so get those two  attacks in and dash back so this differs  a little bit to the first phase because  before you were staying quite in close  contact with him but in the second phase  you're not going to want to do that  you'll have trouble trading with him  because if he gets the advantage it's  much easier for him to keep you in range  so attack him when he's vulnerable his  spin attack for example leaves him  vulnerable for a moment so does his  lunge just attack whenever you see an  opening  when Gascoigne transforms into the third  phase the fight can go badly very  quickly it's no longer as easy to regain  that health his beast form has way more  poise so he won't let you recover health  easily the most common death here is  simply from being combo'd because he's  constantly attempting to get in your  space and it's quite easy to get trapped  in a bunch of gravestones the two best  ways to kill him in this phase are with  the music box or with the gun it's  always start off with the music box  you'll notice I told you not to use the  music box until the third phase this way  you save your stun for when he's at the  most dangerous and you don't force his  Beast form early the first music box  stun blasts a ridiculously long time but  you only get one stun  so make use of it get behind him and  fully charge gnar to attack for a  backstab if you don't have the music box  though your best friend here is your gun  you want to lock onto him and constantly  be backpedaling because what you're  looking for are repulsed opportunities  his attacks seem quite complex but the  most common attack is the one with an  initial wind-up followed by a flurry  like you see here it's best to try and  hit him on that first wind up like this  and if you're out of bullets  you might find it easier to switch to  Molotov cocktails if you find yourself  caught in a flurry or stamped to the  ground mash that circle button and don't  dodge backwards because if he has you in  melee range chances are he can keep you  in it if you're already getting here  dodged the side but if you are on the  ground don't think you're immune you're  not like you were in the souls games  mash that circle button and you'll  actually dodge a lot easier than you'd  think you could if this was a Souls game  if you're new to this channel welcome  this channel is devoted to souls games  and currently we have blood-borne on the  horizon for a while so feel free to  subscribe and join our community if you  have something to add to this video then  let me know what are your strategies for  defeating Gascoigne in the description  there's a link to the extra life page  for this boss fight so you can add your  own information and help out the  community jeez guys the next few videos  are going to be very interesting I think  you

